    "markdown": "## Rolling deploys\n\nA rolling deploy replaces instances in batches.\nEach batch waits for health checks.\n\n```sh\n# not a heading\nrelish apply app.toml\n```\n\n### Rollback\n\nA failed rolling deploy rolls back.",
